//TEST(compute):COMPARE_COMPUTE_EX(filecheck-buffer=CHECK):-cpu -compute -shaderobj -output-using-type

// Regression guard for shader-slang/slang#12604 (stack safety). The specialization
// work-list walk was mutually recursive over the forward use chain; this file builds a
// 4000-deep linear dependent chain (each v_i uses v_(i-1)) so the walk descends that far.
// The iterative `expandUseClosure` handles it; reverting to the mutual recursion risks a
// stack overflow on a chain this deep. The seed is read from a buffer so the front-end
// cannot constant-fold the chain away before specialization runs.

